WEBVTT

00:00:04.110 --> 00:00:11.290
To fight against messengers from the future who are changing history to erase soccer...

00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:16.430
...we, the Raimon Eleven, are now traveling through time to assemble the strongest eleven in history.

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:22.780
Goal!

00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:25.500
Imagawa takes another point!

00:00:26.030 --> 00:00:27.540
N-No way!

00:00:28.270 --> 00:00:30.370
At this rate, the team will fall to pieces.

00:00:30.370 --> 00:00:32.590
I have to rally them together somehow.

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:34.550
Takuto-sama...

00:02:21.020 --> 00:02:23.590
One-Night Castle doesn't work anymore.

00:02:23.590 --> 00:02:25.290
What do we do now?

00:02:27.290 --> 00:02:30.440
The match resumes. Will Oda recover?

00:02:30.440 --> 00:02:32.000
The opponent has momentum on their side.

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:32.880
Don't panic!

00:02:34.260 --> 00:02:35.130
You won't get past us!

00:02:36.520 --> 00:02:36.960
Fei!

00:02:39.680 --> 00:02:40.300
You're stopping here!

00:02:45.120 --> 00:02:48.550
Shindou is diving deep into Imagawa territory!

00:02:49.590 --> 00:02:50.560
He's so desperate.

00:02:50.790 --> 00:02:53.210
Shindou, don't break up formation!

00:02:53.210 --> 00:02:55.770
No, that's it! Keep charging in!

00:02:55.770 --> 00:02:56.860
What?!

00:02:57.460 --> 00:02:58.890
Shindou heads for the goal!

00:02:59.550 --> 00:03:01.660
But he's surrounded by defenders!

00:03:01.920 --> 00:03:03.360
It's over for you.

00:03:04.080 --> 00:03:06.870
Shindou's shoot course is completely blocked!

00:03:07.260 --> 00:03:08.070
Shindou-senpai!

00:03:08.510 --> 00:03:10.030
Pass! Pass to him!

00:03:10.030 --> 00:03:11.660
Go, shoot!

00:03:11.660 --> 00:03:13.540
Quit making orders!

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:14.320
Say that again?!

00:03:16.090 --> 00:03:16.940
I'll do it this time!

00:03:23.730 --> 00:03:25.880
Instrumentalist Maestro!

00:03:27.590 --> 00:03:28.430
Armed!

00:03:34.450 --> 00:03:35.030
No good.

00:03:37.690 --> 00:03:39.080
Have you had enough?

00:03:42.440 --> 00:03:43.360
Takuto-sama!

00:03:43.710 --> 00:03:44.750
How unsightly.

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:50.110
Medam passes to Orca! Imagawa counterattacks!

00:03:50.800 --> 00:03:53.040
How do I use Avatar Armed?

00:03:55.320 --> 00:03:57.540
They're being pushed back.

00:03:57.900 --> 00:04:01.800
It may be kemari, but if we lose, it will bring shame to the Oda name.

00:04:02.110 --> 00:04:03.670
Let us put a stop to this.

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:08.860
<i>Unfortunately, Nobunaga-sama, you do not rule the country.</i>

00:04:10.250 --> 00:04:12.520
Shindou Takuto... is it?

00:04:14.330 --> 00:04:15.800
My lord?

00:04:16.690 --> 00:04:17.980
Drim!

00:04:18.350 --> 00:04:20.280
Imagawa makes quick passes!

00:04:20.280 --> 00:04:22.280
The ball goes to their forward!

00:04:22.960 --> 00:04:23.980
H-He's coming!

00:04:24.290 --> 00:04:26.030
Tasuke, use One-Night Castle!

00:04:26.620 --> 00:04:27.680
Tasuke!

00:04:27.960 --> 00:04:28.850
Let's do it!

00:04:28.850 --> 00:04:29.700
We have to try!

00:04:30.070 --> 00:04:31.040
Let's go!

00:04:31.270 --> 00:04:32.750
R-Right!

00:04:35.400 --> 00:04:37.130
One-Night Castle!

00:04:38.280 --> 00:04:39.500
Great, keep it up!

00:04:41.020 --> 00:04:41.510
Over here!

00:04:43.920 --> 00:04:46.180
Matsukaze makes a brilliant intercept!

00:04:47.710 --> 00:04:48.890
Tsurugi!

00:04:49.670 --> 00:04:50.630
Shindou-senpai!

00:04:51.870 --> 00:04:53.250
Don't be rash, Shindou!

00:04:53.250 --> 00:04:54.730
Pass the ball!

00:04:54.730 --> 00:04:56.790
Keep it and go!

00:04:56.790 --> 00:05:00.310
Why do you keep encouraging him? The blood's gone to his head-

00:05:00.310 --> 00:05:02.090
I have my reasons!

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:03.340
Reasons?

00:05:04.250 --> 00:05:08.610
Shindou needs to gain enough power to take in Nobunaga's energy.

00:05:09.380 --> 00:05:11.070
Nobunaga-sama's energy?

00:05:11.860 --> 00:05:14.040
Shindou is surrounded!

00:05:14.810 --> 00:05:15.550
This time!

00:05:16.520 --> 00:05:17.290
Armed!

00:05:18.930 --> 00:05:21.790
Shindou fails at Avatar Armed again!

00:05:21.790 --> 00:05:22.550
It's mine!

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:25.090
Gimme the ball!

00:05:25.460 --> 00:05:26.190
Oh no!

00:05:26.190 --> 00:05:27.760
Beta is free!

00:05:28.320 --> 00:05:29.740
Orca makes a long pass!

00:05:30.090 --> 00:05:30.760
Oh no!

00:05:32.370 --> 00:05:33.680
I won't let you!

00:05:37.880 --> 00:05:38.610
He reached it!

00:05:41.270 --> 00:05:42.240
Tasuke!

00:05:42.240 --> 00:05:43.470
Are you okay?

00:05:46.370 --> 00:05:47.700
What a nuisance.

00:05:48.370 --> 00:05:50.020
We're saved.

00:05:50.020 --> 00:05:51.300
My lord!

00:05:51.300 --> 00:05:53.160
Please wait!

00:05:57.320 --> 00:05:58.980
N-Nobunaga-sama?!

00:05:59.640 --> 00:06:00.500
What?

00:06:01.870 --> 00:06:03.380
Shindou Takuto!

00:06:03.380 --> 00:06:04.550
Come here!

00:06:06.390 --> 00:06:07.590
Takuto-sama!

00:06:10.050 --> 00:06:10.780
Shindou!

00:06:12.250 --> 00:06:14.530
What is with that fighting style?

00:06:14.530 --> 00:06:17.640
We are being pushed behind because you are at fault!

00:06:18.190 --> 00:06:22.110
If you continue to drag down our formation, it is best that you leave.

00:06:25.020 --> 00:06:27.560
Nobunaga-sama is angry...

00:06:27.560 --> 00:06:29.850
I must do something...

00:06:31.080 --> 00:06:32.560
Nobunaga-sa...

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:33.410
Please, I beg you!

00:06:34.120 --> 00:06:36.950
Please allow Takuto-sama to continue playing!

00:06:38.210 --> 00:06:39.960
Hold your tongue, little girl!

00:06:40.790 --> 00:06:44.800
Takuto-sama trains diligently for soccer with all of his might!

00:06:45.460 --> 00:06:47.900
He practices night and day just to win.

00:06:48.300 --> 00:06:52.400
So please allow him to keep playing!

00:06:52.790 --> 00:06:53.970
Okatsu-san...

00:06:58.610 --> 00:06:59.690
Do not fear, little girl.

00:07:00.850 --> 00:07:04.230
Why do you move when there is no need?

00:07:04.750 --> 00:07:06.710
You move too much.

00:07:07.680 --> 00:07:10.920
Determining when to be still and when to move is an essential point in strategy!

00:07:11.680 --> 00:07:13.200
To be still and to move?

00:07:13.810 --> 00:07:20.420
Is it not your duty to act as the pivot between offense and defense?

00:07:21.300 --> 00:07:24.110
What you have been doing is not wrong...

00:07:24.110 --> 00:07:25.960
...but it can be easily predicted by the opponent.

00:07:26.530 --> 00:07:28.850
He already knows that much?

00:07:28.850 --> 00:07:31.430
He's only watched the game once.

00:07:31.740 --> 00:07:38.010
<i>A gamemaker of truth who can appraise people and the general situation, while combining both stillness and motion.</i>

00:07:38.620 --> 00:07:40.210
There's no mistake.

00:07:40.210 --> 00:07:41.930
This man is the one.

00:07:43.620 --> 00:07:46.080
Thank you for your words of advice.

00:07:47.240 --> 00:07:49.720
Now, will Oda be able to take back a point?

00:07:52.800 --> 00:07:55.760
Here's the plan for now, then.

00:07:56.700 --> 00:07:59.120
Shindou, don't touch the ball.

00:08:00.380 --> 00:08:02.830
Toukichirou-san, we can't have that!

00:08:03.280 --> 00:08:04.710
I know.

00:08:04.710 --> 00:08:08.080
This match is not just about winning, right?

00:08:08.080 --> 00:08:09.000
Yes.

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:11.550
Then you can't touch the ball.

00:08:12.430 --> 00:08:14.150
Not until the time comes.

00:08:16.870 --> 00:08:18.390
Given up, have you?

00:08:20.620 --> 00:08:21.480
Everyone!

00:08:21.750 --> 00:08:23.200
Blaze through them like fire!

00:08:23.700 --> 00:08:24.520
Okay!

00:08:24.900 --> 00:08:26.100
Steal the ball!

00:08:28.410 --> 00:08:32.720
Oda takes on a daring offense, but Imagawa does not back down!

00:08:36.120 --> 00:08:38.190
No one is watching me.

00:08:42.230 --> 00:08:43.450
That's it.

00:08:43.450 --> 00:08:45.580
Quietly, so that no one notices you.

00:08:48.580 --> 00:08:50.250
You're cornered.

00:08:51.920 --> 00:08:52.510
Now!

00:08:52.770 --> 00:08:54.090
Shindou-kun!

00:08:56.300 --> 00:08:57.800
You!

00:08:59.690 --> 00:09:03.310
<i>Determining when to be still and when to move is an essential point in strategy!</i>

00:09:14.070 --> 00:09:16.590
Instrumentalist Maestro!

00:09:17.280 --> 00:09:18.660
Armed!

00:09:31.720 --> 00:09:32.960
He did it!

00:09:32.960 --> 00:09:33.920
All right!

00:09:34.990 --> 00:09:35.550
Here I go!

00:09:35.770 --> 00:09:36.370
Come on!

00:09:41.510 --> 00:09:44.020
Keeper Command 03!

00:09:47.160 --> 00:09:49.410
Oda makes a tie!

00:09:50.250 --> 00:09:51.440
Takuto-sama!

00:09:52.250 --> 00:09:53.980
What foolishness is this?!

00:09:55.530 --> 00:09:57.070
Magnificent!

00:10:04.580 --> 00:10:06.130
That's it, Shindou!!!

00:10:06.130 --> 00:10:08.580
I bet you'll be able to do it now!!!

00:10:09.200 --> 00:10:10.710
Nobunaga-sama!!!

00:10:12.330 --> 00:10:14.210
Mixi-max, you say?

00:10:14.710 --> 00:10:18.220
We want to borrow your power.

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:20.120
For the future!

00:10:20.740 --> 00:10:22.890
You mean to fire this at both me and Shindou?

00:10:24.480 --> 00:10:26.550
They wish to shoot at my lord with a gun!

00:10:26.550 --> 00:10:29.230
These men are indeed knaves!

00:10:29.750 --> 00:10:31.640
They aren't weapons.

00:10:31.640 --> 00:10:34.520
It's a tool that will send Nobunaga's power to Shindou!

00:10:35.380 --> 00:10:36.910
My power...

00:10:37.560 --> 00:10:38.550
To Shindou?

00:10:42.500 --> 00:10:45.850
Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone!

00:10:47.700 --> 00:10:51.010
Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone!

00:10:53.490 --> 00:10:54.710
Interesting.

00:10:54.710 --> 00:10:55.960
Show me.

00:10:55.960 --> 00:10:57.160
You have my gratitude!

00:10:57.160 --> 00:10:58.760
My lord!

00:10:59.370 --> 00:11:02.970
Through your eyes, you shall see that they speak true.

00:11:03.350 --> 00:11:06.220
Now, to the frontline!

00:11:07.040 --> 00:11:09.160
Only a few moments remain!

00:11:09.160 --> 00:11:12.720
Will Oda and Imagawa's fateful confrontation meet a conclusion?!

00:11:14.690 --> 00:11:16.860
Beat them so hard they never get back up again!

00:11:18.980 --> 00:11:19.650
Reiza!

00:11:21.520 --> 00:11:23.750
We'll win this match for sure!

00:11:23.990 --> 00:11:24.950
Now!

00:11:33.700 --> 00:11:36.840
Mixi-max complete!

00:11:42.910 --> 00:11:45.100
All right, it worked!

00:11:45.810 --> 00:11:47.850
Shin-sama looks so wild!

00:11:49.360 --> 00:11:50.810
You have a good look on you.

00:11:51.230 --> 00:11:52.350
Impossible...

00:11:52.350 --> 00:11:53.560
How was he able to do it this time?!

00:11:54.220 --> 00:11:55.340
You've got to be kidding me!

00:12:01.970 --> 00:12:02.700
He's fast!

00:12:03.140 --> 00:12:06.780
Shindou moves wonderfully as he advances!

00:12:21.510 --> 00:12:23.800
Split-second Boost!

00:12:26.780 --> 00:12:28.270
Keeper Comma-

00:12:27.220 --> 00:12:28.550
It's me you're fighting!

00:12:32.340 --> 00:12:34.720
Goddess of the Vacant Skies, Athena!

00:12:35.890 --> 00:12:37.150
Armed!

00:12:46.240 --> 00:12:48.720
I can stop this!

00:12:52.540 --> 00:12:54.290
Goal!

00:12:54.290 --> 00:12:57.020
Oda makes a turnaround goal!

00:13:01.570 --> 00:13:02.300
I did it!

00:13:03.550 --> 00:13:04.700
What?

00:13:04.700 --> 00:13:07.240
What is going on here?

00:13:09.930 --> 00:13:12.270
The match ends!

00:13:12.720 --> 00:13:15.270
All right!

00:13:22.290 --> 00:13:23.980
I don't believe it.

00:13:23.980 --> 00:13:26.280
We lost...

00:13:27.370 --> 00:13:29.990
Turn the other Raimon members back to normal.

00:13:31.740 --> 00:13:33.430
Take off the mind control.

00:13:42.070 --> 00:13:44.070
It's done.

00:13:44.070 --> 00:13:45.130
Happy now?

00:13:47.840 --> 00:13:48.800
Thank goodness!

00:13:49.300 --> 00:13:51.420
Where's Coach?

00:13:51.420 --> 00:13:53.600
He should be locked up in there.

00:13:54.210 --> 00:13:56.100
He isn't in here anymore.

00:13:56.100 --> 00:13:57.530
What?

00:13:57.530 --> 00:13:59.310
See for yourself.

00:14:00.630 --> 00:14:01.760
She's telling the truth.

00:14:01.760 --> 00:14:03.610
He's not inside here.

00:14:03.610 --> 00:14:04.480
No way!

00:14:05.100 --> 00:14:07.900
Then where is Coach Endou?

00:14:09.420 --> 00:14:12.910
It was a good idea to have Endou Mamoru transferred beforehand.

00:14:14.280 --> 00:14:17.790
The unstable factor within Beta was already well analyzed.

00:14:17.790 --> 00:14:20.140
You are going to help us.

00:14:20.660 --> 00:14:23.760
That Chrono Stone is Endou Mamoru?

00:14:23.760 --> 00:14:28.170
It appears that they intend to increase their power through Mixi-max.

00:14:29.470 --> 00:14:33.180
The Chrono Stone amplifies the power of the soul it is derived from,

00:14:33.750 --> 00:14:39.440
and the power of a strong soul heavily draws out other souls.

00:14:40.230 --> 00:14:45.070
The reason they were able to Mixi-max with Nobunaga's high-class aura...

00:14:45.280 --> 00:14:49.200
...was unmistakably due to the influence of Endou Daisuke's Chrono Stone.

00:14:49.520 --> 00:14:59.870
Therefore, why not use Endou Mamoru's soul, as he possesses power that is equal to, perhaps even higher than, Endou Daisuke?

00:15:04.920 --> 00:15:05.880
That's...!

00:15:08.700 --> 00:15:10.670
That was pathetic, Beta.

00:15:11.590 --> 00:15:15.150
And you call yourself one of El Dorado's chosen administrators?

00:15:16.990 --> 00:15:18.010
Gamma...

00:15:19.380 --> 00:15:23.220
This is the end for Protocol Omega 2.0.

00:15:24.550 --> 00:15:27.360
Come. Master is waiting.

00:15:39.600 --> 00:15:41.210
It was an admirable battle.

00:15:41.670 --> 00:15:43.630
Y-Yes, sir!

00:15:44.070 --> 00:15:47.230
Did you see the panic on Imagawa Yoshimoto's face?

00:15:47.230 --> 00:15:49.470
I could feel the pleasure of it all the way down to my toes.

00:15:50.290 --> 00:15:52.810
Just you wait, Nobunaga!

00:15:52.810 --> 00:15:56.760
I will put an end to you in a real battle next time!

00:16:00.580 --> 00:16:02.310
Thank you for the food!

00:16:07.790 --> 00:16:09.380
Shindou Takuto.

00:16:09.590 --> 00:16:12.400
I have shared with you my power.

00:16:12.950 --> 00:16:14.010
Your kemari battle...

00:16:14.010 --> 00:16:17.620
No, in your time you call it soccer, do you not?

00:16:18.320 --> 00:16:19.950
May you adhere to it well.

00:16:20.370 --> 00:16:21.390
Yes, sir.

00:16:21.390 --> 00:16:23.970
I will never forget the graces you have bestowed upon me.

00:16:25.930 --> 00:16:27.270
Incidentally, Shindou.

00:16:27.490 --> 00:16:29.630
You told me that I will not rule the country.

00:16:31.370 --> 00:16:34.970
Do you believe their story, my lord?

00:16:35.700 --> 00:16:39.680
It is highly likely that everything they have said is the truth.

00:16:40.380 --> 00:16:46.140
If they had intended to talk their way out back then, they would have proclaimed that I would rule.

00:16:46.140 --> 00:16:51.280
However, through his eyes, I saw that even though he shook with fear, he spoke truth.

00:16:52.460 --> 00:16:59.310
Nevertheless, what a fearless man you are to declare to me that I would not rule.

00:17:02.100 --> 00:17:04.770
I want to ask you one last thing.

00:17:04.770 --> 00:17:05.690
Yes, sir.

00:17:06.920 --> 00:17:09.000
Can history be changed?

00:17:10.510 --> 00:17:12.440
I... don't know...

00:17:13.750 --> 00:17:15.950
You don't know?

00:17:16.140 --> 00:17:17.670
I apologize.

00:17:20.230 --> 00:17:22.060
Ruling the country is my dream.

00:17:22.850 --> 00:17:26.290
So it is my destiny that I do not achieve my dream.

00:17:27.670 --> 00:17:31.530
But Nobunaga-sama, you have greatly influenced history.

00:17:31.530 --> 00:17:33.740
No, you still do.

00:17:34.380 --> 00:17:39.870
Nobunaga-sama, I dare say that you may even have the power to change people's destinies.

00:17:41.100 --> 00:17:44.340
Do I have the power to change my own destiny then, as well?

00:17:44.950 --> 00:17:46.160
Yes.

00:17:48.890 --> 00:17:52.050
Then I will continue to dream on obtaining rule of the country just a little bit longer.

00:17:52.940 --> 00:17:55.800
Your determination as you fought to the very end...

00:17:56.600 --> 00:17:58.180
...was a pleasure to see.

00:17:59.730 --> 00:18:01.370
Power #1.

00:18:01.370 --> 00:18:02.970
Like Oda Nobunaga,

00:18:02.970 --> 00:18:09.480
a gamemaker of truth who can appraise people and the general situation, while combining both stillness and motion.

00:18:09.790 --> 00:18:13.730
He is truly the power #1 that I have sought.

00:18:18.930 --> 00:18:21.630
What strange boys they were.

00:18:21.630 --> 00:18:23.280
I am still in a state of disbelief.

00:18:24.460 --> 00:18:25.270
Toukichirou!

00:18:25.270 --> 00:18:26.000
Yes, sir!

00:18:26.530 --> 00:18:29.180
Your commands were brilliant.

00:18:29.180 --> 00:18:30.750
Y-Yes, sir!

00:18:31.350 --> 00:18:33.750
I want to test your abilities.

00:18:33.750 --> 00:18:35.880
You will serve me henceforth.

00:18:37.340 --> 00:18:39.300
Nobunaga-sama!

00:18:43.770 --> 00:18:44.850
It's time to say goodbye.

00:18:45.550 --> 00:18:49.020
I'm glad I got to play soccer with you guys.

00:18:49.630 --> 00:18:51.060
Same here!

00:18:52.780 --> 00:18:54.320
I'm going out on a journey.

00:18:55.850 --> 00:18:59.520
There are so many places I don't know about in this country.

00:18:59.790 --> 00:19:02.280
All I know is the Owari Province.

00:19:02.280 --> 00:19:05.340
So I want to see different things as I walk around.

00:19:05.340 --> 00:19:12.160
Thanks to Tenma, I know now that this world is filled with so many exciting things.

00:19:12.160 --> 00:19:12.830
Tasuke...

00:19:13.510 --> 00:19:17.600
When I come back here after my travels and I'm serious about inheriting my family's business...

00:19:17.600 --> 00:19:20.760
I think I can be the best tofu maker in the country.

00:19:21.270 --> 00:19:22.350
I see.

00:19:22.350 --> 00:19:24.080
You're thinking of a lot of options.

00:19:24.080 --> 00:19:25.720
Of course!

00:19:27.290 --> 00:19:29.970
So, we won't be seeing each other anymore.

00:19:30.680 --> 00:19:33.570
I'm not from this time period.

00:19:34.380 --> 00:19:35.320
Yes.

00:19:35.770 --> 00:19:39.070
I already knew that my feelings would never reach you.

00:19:41.900 --> 00:19:43.070
I'm sorry.

00:19:45.210 --> 00:19:46.280
Please take this.

00:19:52.180 --> 00:19:54.280
Well, I'm going.

00:19:55.890 --> 00:19:57.000
I also...!

00:19:59.960 --> 00:20:01.470
Never mind.

00:20:03.120 --> 00:20:04.390
Okatsu-san.

00:20:04.390 --> 00:20:06.760
I'll be sure to take them back once more...

00:20:07.520 --> 00:20:10.440
The important things that I must not lose.

00:20:11.300 --> 00:20:12.310
Yes.

00:20:40.220 --> 00:20:47.210
Still, I can't believe that Toukichirou-san is going to inherit Nobunaga-sama's dream and rule the country.

00:20:47.210 --> 00:20:48.800
Toyotomi Hideyoshi, huh...

00:20:49.360 --> 00:20:54.040
You can't judge a book by its cover, or maybe you can.

00:20:54.260 --> 00:20:56.520
But it was a relief to me.

00:20:57.360 --> 00:21:03.030
Even people in the Sengoku era understood how much fun soccer is. It made me think...

00:21:03.510 --> 00:21:06.070
...that soccer would never disappear.

00:21:06.070 --> 00:21:07.520
That's right!

00:21:07.520 --> 00:21:09.700
Great words, Tenma!

00:21:12.620 --> 00:21:18.210
<i>Eating pure white tofu will make your heart pure white as well, and you'll feel better again.</i>

00:21:24.130 --> 00:21:25.830
Okatsu-san...

00:22:53.680 --> 00:22:56.220
A time paradox brings out a new member.

00:22:56.220 --> 00:22:57.800
And it's a girl!

00:22:57.800 --> 00:23:01.300
Also, our next fight takes place in France during the Middle Ages!

00:23:01.300 --> 00:23:03.670
Next, Everyone Is Back!

00:23:03.670 --> 00:23:06.110
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:23:15.020 --> 00:23:19.220
The Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone's proverb today is...

00:23:22.160 --> 00:23:26.160
Determining when to be still and when to move is an essential point in strategy!

00:23:26.160 --> 00:23:27.280
That's all!
